requirement_id: "REQ-impl-region-transport"
reason: "Clause-scoped independent checking and concrete-oracle populations support conditional typed source-region transport, including finite deterministic occurrence paths with complete successor slots, actual predecessor phis, whole-state boundary unions and checked progress. Complete invariant evidence across the requirement remains outstanding: these bounded shapes and input populations do not establish every admitted source owner, initial state, control edge, alias or summary allocation, captured environment, correlated aggregate, call/effect boundary and certificate dependency together. Unsupported branches, recurrent calls and recurrent allocations remain explicit refusals in the finite arm. Imported initialization, intervening frame, concurrency, selected native and harness premises retain their own evidence obligations. Finite source progress and a complete selected source return do not establish optimized selected source/native correspondence or rooted entry-state applicability. The conditional IEEE storage model retains its separate applicability antecedent; language zero initialization supplies no native bytes. This is an uncovered evidence obligation, not a demonstrated implementation contradiction."
